{{DISPLAYTITLE:<span class="text-champion">Heroic Musketeer</span>}}{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}{{Heroic Card Infobox|Cost=4|Rarity=Rare|Type=Troop|Arena=Training Camp|ReleaseDate=December 1 2025|AbilityCost=3}}
{{Quote|Hero Musketeer has a new best friend: the boom building! This scrappy guy shoots fast and hard, making her boomstick suuuuuper jealous.}}
The Musketeer is a {{Rarity|Rare}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked in the [[Training Camp]]. It spawns one single-target, air-targeting, long-ranged, and ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with moderate hitpoints and moderate damage. The Heroic Musketeer takes the appearance of a woman who has golden glowing eyes, coiffed curly hair and eyebrows, and wears a gold breastplate, chainmail, a team-colored cape, a beige helmet with a gold handle in a similar style helmet as one of the [[Three Musketeers]] helmets, a belt, beige shoulder pads with gold handles as their base, brown gloves and boots with golden soles and chains, while carrying a beige blunderbuss-styled musket with a golden trigger and muzzle as her weapon with dark gray spheres as her ammunition. She also wields a turret with a large gold handle and base supported by a metal handle in-between and a long, gold and black striped tube, while having the same hat as the Musketeer. A Heroic Musketeer card costs 4 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to deploy and her ability costs an additional 3 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to activate.

==Ability: Trusty Turret==
{{Quote|Spawns a short-range auto-turret in front of the Musketeer.}}{{Hero Ability|2=Musketeer-Heroic}}
The Hero Musketeer has a special ability accessible from whatever side of the screen was put in, just above the player's [[Cards|card]] slots in [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. After a 1-second delay, the Hero Musketeer activates her “Trusty Turret”, placing a turret 3 tiles forward of the Musketeer, which is used either as a distraction for regular troops, and as a building to attract win conditions. This turret has a lifetime of 10 seconds, meaning that this is meant to be used reactively as it's not meant to last that long, unless the building is destroyed before the Decay kills it. The Trusty Turret ability costs 3 {{Icon|I=Elixir}} to activate.

==Strategy==
*For the purposes of determining [[Elixir]] trades, the Heroic Musketeer and her activated Ability count as 7 Elixir, as the player must play the 4 Elixir Heroic Musketeer and then spend a further 3 on her Ability.
*Do not use the ability against an enemy [[Electro Giant]]. Not only does it worsen the Elixir cost against him, but it will also lure him towards the Turret, which will cause the Heroic Musketeer to take damage and eventually destroy herself through his Zap Pack. It is better to use her at a range, as either she will defeat him without taking damage, or will force the opponent to pull her within his Zap Pack range by using a [[Tornado]] or a [[Fisherman]].

