== History ==
2025
*The Hero Musketeer [[Cards|card]] was added to the game with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|December 2025 Update]] on 1/12/2025{{Balance|Add}}.
2026
* On 12/1/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/1/2026)|Balance Update]], increased turret deploy time to 2 seconds (from 1 second){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* on 2/2/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased turret range to 4.0 (from 5.5){{Balance|Nerf}}, and Hero Musketeer deploy time to 1 (from 2){{Balance|Buff}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], made the ability single use (from 22sec cooldown){{Balance|Remove}}.

